"Bottleneck_module":"The tactic Bottleneck module addresses the stimulus inference request by applying the architectural modification of introducing a network module to compress intermediate representations within the inference pipeline into a lower-dimensional latent space, before expanding and forwarding it to the artifact AI model during the development phase of Design Definition Process, resulting in the system response of executing inference with reduced complexity.",
"Buffering":"The tactic Buffering addresses the stimulus data units arriving from the producer at a rate exceeding the consumer component's current processing rate by applying the architectural modification of introducing an intermediate buffer component between producer and consumer that temporarily stores incoming data units when the producer's output rate exceeds the consumer's processing rate to the artifact software system during the development phase of System Architecture Definition, resulting in the system response of writing incoming data units into the intermediate buffer upon arrival and releasing them to the consumer at the consumer's processing rate, thereby decoupling the producer's write rate from the consumer's read rate.",
