"Classification_analysis_below_threshold":"The tactic Classification analysis below threshold addresses the stimulus inference request producing a prediction with confidence score below the defined acceptance threshold by applying the architectural modification of routing low-confidence predictions to a secondary analysis pipeline or human review workflow to the artifact inference pipeline during the development phase of Design Definition Process, resulting in the system response of forwarding uncertain predictions through an alternative processing path instead of returning them as final outputs.",
