"Kernel_regularization":"The tactic Kernel regularization addresses the stimulus a gradient update step computed on a training batch by applying the architectural modification of adding a regularization penalty to network parameter magnitudes to the artifact AI model during the development phase of Modeling, resulting in the system response of computing parameter updates by combining the task loss gradient with a penalty term proportional to the magnitude of each network parameter.",
