"Layer_fusion":"The tactic Layer fusion addresses the stimulus CNN inference execution on memory-bandwidth-limited accelerator hardware by applying the architectural modification of sending layer outputs directly to next layer inputs without intermediate memory access to the artifact AI model during the development phase of Integration, resulting in the system response of executing CNN inference with reduced off-chip data movement by bypassing memory for inter-layer data transfer.",
